{"availability":"available","full":"svenschultze/voix-kanban","name":"voix-kanban","description":"Multimodal Kanban App for VOIX framework","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-11T20:24:57Z","updated":"2025-11-12T16:01:31Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://svenschultze.github.io/voix-kanban/","topics":["demo","voix"],"demo":"https://svenschultze.github.io/voix-kanban/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:03:10.603Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T21:03:10.603Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T21:03:10.603Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:00:38.453Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:03:10.603Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["VOIX Kanban is a single-page demo workspace that showcases how a Vue 3 UI can expose its state to VOIX tools. It mixes a polished kanban experience (drag & drop, filtering, time logging) with live “context” blocks and a declarative belt so AI agents can reason about and manipulate the board exactly as a human would. This project exists as a demo app for the VOIX framework, illustrating how a traditional UI can surface board, profile, and interaction state to multimodal assistants."],"features":["Responsive Vue 3 kanban board with To Do / In Progress / Done columns and a customizable column editor (add, rename, reorder, recolor, or remove columns).","Task creation form with column picker, multi-select gestures (click, shift+click, cmd/ctrl+click), and drag-and-drop between columns (supports group drag based on selection).","Rich task cards: open detail modal, edit title/description inline, log time, add comments, assign/unassign teammates, duplicate/delete via custom context menu.","Board-level filters: global search (title, description, comments), assignee dropdown, “only my tasks” toggle, and reset button—filters also cascade to all exported VOIX contexts.","Profile side panel that surfaces personal stats, lets you edit the signed-in user, and echoes applied filters and roster data."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/svenschultze/voix-kanban/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"867f250deb6596471808b02d965d1ab2c716a8268ea95958b952ecdda55a25bb","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:38.653Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:38.653Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"VOIX Kanban is a single-page demo workspace that showcases how a Vue 3 UI can expose its state to VOIX tools. It mixes a polished kanban experience (drag & drop, filtering, time logging) with live “context” blocks and a declarative belt so AI agents can reason about and manipulate the board exactly as a human would. This project exists as a demo app for the VOIX framework, illustrating how a traditional UI can surface board, profile, and interaction state to multimodal assistants.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/svenschultze/voix-kanban/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"867f250deb6596471808b02d965d1ab2c716a8268ea95958b952ecdda55a25bb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/svenschultze/voix-kanban/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:38.653Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-11-12T16:01:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/svenschultze/voix-kanban/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:38.653Z","hash":"867f250deb6596471808b02d965d1ab2c716a8268ea95958b952ecdda55a25bb","originalBytes":6095,"storedBytes":6095,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["profile","tasks","add","board","column","columns","voix","state","vue","context","filters","app","delete","time","drag","task","comments","drop","kanban","modal","move","panel","persistence","belt","build","click","data.js","detail","edit","how","index.html","inline","interaction","it.","key","localstorage","menu","open","plus","stats","teammates","via","voix-kanban-state","active","any","app.js","assign","assignee","assignments","based